    "title": "Where is TPC Sawgrass and The Players Championship 2026 located?",
    "text": "JOIN GNN FOR FREE FOR DISTRACTION-FREE READING Golf News Net members don't see our floating video player (when logged in) and get an exclusive newsletter! By signing up for an account, you agree to sign up for our newsletter, The Break. You can unsubscribe at any time and keep your membership. Watch About Connatix Visit Advertiser websiteGO TO PAGEStarting anew at The Players with Jan Stephenson: The Road... Legendary sports journalist Len Ziehm at the PGA... Golf legend Jan Stephenson at the PGA Merchandise... People's League CEO Jared Augustine at the PGA... Former Bachelor Ben Higgins loves Indiana football, French Lick Former Bachelor Wells Adams now talking golf every day John Smoltz says the PGA Tour might copy The Pro golf... Brian Urlacher loves the future for the Chicago Bears A look back at 2025 on The Road to French Lick Adam Schenk won putting one-handed on the PGA Tour; he... Golfing In Indiana: The Pfau Course at Indiana University Golfing In Indiana: Maple Creek Golf Club Golfing In Indiana: Sultan's Run Golfing In Indiana: Tippecanoe Country Club Golfing In Indiana: Harrison Hills Golf Club Golfing In Indiana: The Fort at Fort Harrison State Park Golfing In Indiana: University of Notre Dame's Warren... Korn Ferry Tour Graduation Day: The Road to French... Golfing In Indiana: The Pete Dye Course at French Lick Resort Golfing In Indiana: The Donald Ross Course at French... Golfing In Indiana: Blackthorn Golf Club John VanDerLaan is the Man: The Road to French Lick, 2025,... Zach Bauchou's Big Break in Nashville: The Road to French... Facing the music in Nashville: The Road to French Lick,... Get Ready for the Korn Ferry Tour Finals: The Road to... From Boise back to French Lick: The Road to French... Chisto Lamprecht Takes a Giant Leap to the PGA Tour: The... Julian Suri is surely back: The Road to French Lick, 2025,... Here's Johnny (Keefer!): The Road to French Lick,... Chandler Blanchet's Blitz to Victory: The Road to French... Neal Shipley Wins His 2nd Title: The Road to French Lick,... The 1st 2025 Graduate is Here: The Road to French... Best Ball, Ep. 2: Our Epic Ireland Golf Trip TPC Sawgrass is home to The Players Championship 2026 and its island green par-3 17th hole, one of the most recognizable golf holes on the PGA Tour and one of the best-known golf courses in the United States and the world, and it's home to one of the best golf tournaments on the planet. The Jacksonville-area course has some of the most recognizable holes in the world, including the 16th through 18th holes on the Stadium Course, known as the Gauntlet, as laid down by Pete Dye. Not only is TPC Sawgrass an incredible golf course, but it is also home to the PGA Tour and its 2026 The Players Championship, which features the biggest purse of the year at the home of the PGA Tour. Naturally, a resort hosting a big golf tournament on the PGA Tour leads fans to wonder where TPC Sawgrass is located. TPC Sawgrass is located in a town called Ponte Vedra Beach, Fla. A lot of fans think TPC Sawgrass is in the city of Jacksonville proper, but it's in the nearby town -- at least as far as addresses go. To give a better idea of its location relative to Jacksonville, TPC Sawgrass is southeast of Jacksonville, which sits as the biggest city in the northeast portion of Florida. TPC Sawgrass sits off a road called A-1A, which runs up and down the Atlantic coast. You can play TPC Sawgrass' Stadium Course and the other course on property, Dye's Valley. Neighboring towns to Ponte Vedra Beach include Neptune Beach, Atlantic Beach and Sawgrass. LISTEN TO GOLF NEWS NET RADIO 24/7 FOLLOW GOLF NEWS NET RADIO: iHEART | TUNEIN Which airports are near TPC Sawgrass? Since the biggest city in close proximity to TPC Sawgrass is Jacksonville, the JAX airport is frequently where golfers who are playing at the course will fly into before making the trek. It's an approximately 60-minute drive from the airport to TPC Sawgrass. What other famous golf courses are near TPC Sawgrass? TPC Sawgrass is an iconic golf course in the United States, but it has some incredible neighbors in the golf world. Sawgrass Country Club is nearby and has hosted this event. TPC Sawgrass also has the Dye's Valley Course, which is a fantastic test. On the public side, The Yards is a great, accessible layout. Atantic Beach Country Club has hosted the Korn Ferry Tour Championship in the past as well.",
